			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 742540501,
					"content": "西摩爾！好久不見！還有瑪梅赫也是！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742540502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 742540502,
					"content": "哈哈，西摩爾在旅途中也經常和我說他很想妳們。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742540503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瑪梅赫"
				},
				{
					"id": 742540503,
					"content": "肯定。我無時不在思念著瑪麗安小姐。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742540504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "西摩爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 742540504,
					"content": "也多謝桑多涅小姐願意舉辦這樣一場茶會，讓我們有機會重新聚在一起，聊聊旅途的見聞。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742540505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瑪麗安"
				},
				{
					"id": 742540505,
					"content": "沒什麼。我只是覺得大家多少也算是有歷史淵源的一家人——呃，應該能算吧。所以有空就聚聚沒什麼不好的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742540506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 742540506,
					"content": "一家人？不知道為什麼，聽到這樣的說法我好高興。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742540507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 742540507,
					"content": "那桑多涅小姐算是家裡的…妹妹？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742540508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瑪麗安"
				},
				{
					"id": 742540508,
					"content": "呃…雖說是「一家人」，但算輩分這種事要不要還是免了吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742540509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 742540509,
					"content": "肯定。作為阿蘭先生創造的原型機，桑多涅小姐應該稱呼我為「大哥」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742540510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "西摩爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 742540510,
					"content": "嘖…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742540511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 742540511,
					"content": "真好啊。我也能算是妳們的家庭成員嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742540512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瑪梅赫"
				},
				{
					"id": 742540512,
					"content": "當然可以，這個「家庭」看起來什麼都有了，再來一隻美露莘也沒什麼奇怪的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742540513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 742540513,
					"content": "肯定。瑪梅赫小姐就是我的家人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742540514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "西摩爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 742540514,
					"content": "嘿嘿，真開心。那不如，我來為這個「家庭」畫一幅畫吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742540515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瑪梅赫"
				},
				{
					"id": 742540515,
					"content": "全家福？真是好久沒有過了呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742540516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瑪麗安"
				},
				{
					"id": 742540516,
					"content": "要把我畫得看起來厲害一點哦！就像家裡的姐姐一樣！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742540517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 742540517,
					"content": "嗯！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742540518
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瑪梅赫"
				},
				{
					"id": 742540518,
					"content": "哈…隨你們便吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				}
			]
		},
